---
title: Testing Mermaid
date: 2026-04-18
summary: Verifying the Kroki build-time pipeline for Mermaid diagrams.
---

A flowchart:

```mermaid
%% alt: Decision flow for shipping a diagram
flowchart LR
  A[Write essay] --> B{Need a diagram?}
  B -->|yes| C[Write mermaid block]
  B -->|no| D[Publish]
  C --> E[Preprocessor hits Kroki]
  E --> F[SVG cached by hash]
  F --> D
```

And a sequence diagram:

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Author
  participant Flask
  participant Kroki
  Author->>Flask: freeze.py
  Flask->>Kroki: POST mermaid source
  Kroki-->>Flask: SVG
  Flask->>Flask: cache by content hash
  Flask-->>Author: static HTML + <img>
```

That's it.
